 *
 * App-side overlay for arty_a7_vex. Kept intentionally slim so that per-CPU
 * peripheral placement lives in boards/bard0/arty_a7_vex/arty_a7_vex.dts.
 * Address map matches the mbv32 shell (per project decision):
 *   emacZero      @ 0x44A00000
 *   AXI DMA       @ 0x41E00000
 *   axis_rx_stats @ 0x41F00000
 *   UARTLite      @ 0x40600000
 *   DDR           @ 0x90000000 (240 MiB Zephyr + 16 MiB DMA at 0x9F000000)
 *
 * TODO Step 2: mirror the mbv32.overlay nodes once the base DTS is populated.
 */
